    "3D": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3D"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3D tools": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3Dツール"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A 16-bit grayscale height map replaces the estimate.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "16ビットのグレースケール高さマップが推定値の代わりに使われます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A material sets the relief prior plus tuned relief, roughness and AO. Flat is the safe default for painted or unknown surfaces.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "マテリアルを選ぶと、レリーフ事前設定と、調整済みのレリーフ・ラフネス・AOが設定されます。塗装面や不明な表面には「フラット」が安全な既定値です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A new Mac identity is created. Every paired iPhone must scan a new code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "新しいMac IDが作成されます。ペアリング済みのすべてのiPhoneで新しいコードを読み取る必要があります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A resource pack with LabPBR colour, _n and _s textures for shader packs.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "シェーダーパック向けに、LabPBRのカラー、_n、_sテクスチャを含むリソースパック。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A standard_surface .mtlx with its textures: Houdini, Maya, Blender, USD, Omniverse.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "テクスチャ付きのstandard_surface .mtlx：Houdini、Maya、Blender、USD、Omniverse。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A starting recipe such as Red brick or Brushed steel.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「赤レンガ」や「ヘアライン仕上げの鋼」などの開始レシピ。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A textured plane with base colour, normal and ORM: three.js, Babylon, Blender, most engines.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ベースカラー、ノーマル、ORMを貼った平面：three.js、Babylon、Blender、ほとんどのエンジン。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
