    "Surface": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "表面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SurfaceAppearance colour, normal, roughness and metalness maps (at most 1024²).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "SurfaceAppearance用のカラー、ノーマル、ラフネス、メタルネスマップ（最大1024²）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Synthetic": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "合成素材"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tangent-space normal map; also drives height, AO and the masks.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "接空間ノーマルマップ。高さ、AO、マスクにも反映されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tangent-space surface direction.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "接空間での表面の向き。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terracotta roof tiles": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "テラコッタの屋根瓦"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The .pbrmaterial bundle (every map plus its manifest) is always written. Choose formats to add beside it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ".pbrmaterialバンドル（すべてのマップとマニフェスト）は常に書き出されます。一緒に書き出す形式を選んでください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Neural Engine runs in half precision, so results can differ slightly between chips and macOS versions. CPU only is slower but more reproducible. Estimates are cached per source, so recipe edits never re-run the model.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neural Engineは半精度で動作するため、チップやmacOSのバージョンによって結果がわずかに異なることがあります。「CPUのみ」は低速ですが再現性が高くなります。推定結果はソースごとにキャッシュされるため、レシピを編集してもモデルは再実行されません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The albedo is exported as photographed (plus any Make tileable edge treatment).": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アルベドは撮影したまま書き出されます（「タイル化」の端処理は適用されます）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The albedo stays as photographed, plus any Make tileable edge treatment.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "アルベドは撮影したままで、「タイル化」の端処理のみ適用されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The iPhone pins this Mac's certificate from the one-time code. Every transfer still needs your approval here, and files sent through AirDrop use the same verified .pbrcapture format.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhoneは1回限りのコードからこのMacの証明書を固定します。転送のたびにここでの承認が必要で、AirDropで送ったファイルも同じ検証済みの.pbrcapture形式を使います。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The source is painted or drawn, not photographed. It is recorded as authored; leave Remove baked lighting and Repair albedo off to keep it untouched.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ソースは撮影ではなく、描いたものです。作成者提供として記録されます。そのまま使うには「焼き込まれたライティングを除去」と「アルベドを修復」をオフにしてください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Three by three tiled preview": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3×3のタイルプレビュー"
          }
        }
      }
    },
